  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and standard deviation of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math> observations are found to be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;respectively. On rechecking it was found that, in the observations,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> was misread as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>. Then, the correct variance is equal to _____."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "17",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Old mean<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;(given)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>115</mn></math></p><p>Correct mean<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Given, old variance<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1070</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>var</mi><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1070</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p>"
  }
